<title>Hotel Tranz | Airport link and BTS Hotel, The heart of Bangkok city 5 minutes away from the best shopping areas (Hotel Official Website)</title>
<meta name="keywords" content="Airport Link hotel, BTS hotel, Phyathai hotel, shopping area, lifestyle hotel Phyathai">
<meta name="description" content="Hotel Tranz is truly situated at the heart of Bangkok city with the most convenient access to the city's vibrant attractions. The hotel is amazingly located right in front of the Airport Link's Phyathai station which's also directly connected with BTS Phyathai*. This prime location obtains over 45,000 travelers per day and is less than 5 minutes away from the best shopping areas (IE. Siam Paragon, Siam Center, Siam Square, MBK, Platinum, Central World, and ETC.)
The hotel’s entrance is just few foot steps from the Airport Link station and 15 meters from BTS Phyathai's stair way. Making every visitors' experience the easiest and relaxing journey upon arrival from Suvarnabhumi airport.">
