	<div class="container mar-bot-10">
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-md-5 welcome nopad">
		<h2>Super Prime Location</h2>
		<p><strong>Hotel Tranz</strong> is truly situated at the heart of Bangkok city with the most convenient access to the city's vibrant attractions. The hotel is amazingly located right in front of the 
		Airport Link's Phyathai station which's also directly connected with BTS Phyathai*. This prime location obtains over 45,000 travelers per day and is less than 5 minutes away from the best shopping areas 
		(IE. Siam Paragon, Siam Center, Siam Square, MBK, Platinum, Central World, and ETC.) </p>
		<p>The hotel’s entrance is just few foot steps from the Airport Link station and 15 meters from BTS Phyathai's stair way.  Making every visitors' experience the easiest and relaxing 
		journey upon arrival from Suvarnabhumi airport.</p>
		<ul class="welcome-ic-list">
		<li><img src="images/i-home1.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Hotel Tranz"></li>
		<li><img src="images/i-home2.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Hotel Tranz"></li>
		<li><img src="images/i-home3.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Hotel Tranz"></li>
		</ul>
		</div>
		<div class="col-md-7 welcome-right">
		<div class="col-md-12 locationtime clearfix">
		<div class="time_intro"><div  class="seattle"> <span class="timein">Local Time</span><br>  <strong class="time"></strong> </div><div class="seattle-ic"><i class="far fa-clock fa-2x"></i></div></div>
		<div class="weather_intro"><div id="weather" class="weathersec"></div></div>	
		</div>
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-sm-6 col-xs-6"><div class="wrap-overlay"><img src="images/welcome-img01.jpg" alt="Hotel Tranz"><div class="caption-overlay"></div></div></div>
		<div class="col-sm-6 col-xs-6"><div class="wrap-overlay"><img src="images/welcome-img02.jpg" alt="Hotel Tranz"><div class="caption-overlay"></div></div></div>
		</div>				
		</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-md-7 welcome-right">
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-sm-6 col-xs-6"><div class="wrap-overlay"> <img src="images/welcome-img03.jpg" alt="Hotel Tranz"><div class="caption-overlay"></div></div></div>
		<div class="col-sm-6 col-xs-6"><div class="wrap-overlay"> <img src="images/welcome-img04.jpg" alt="Hotel Tranz"><div class="caption-overlay"></div></div></div>
		</div>				
		</div>
		<div class="col-md-5 welcome nopad">
		<h2>Hotel Tranz <br> <span>The Ultra Convenient Lifestyle Hotel</span></h2>
		<p>The unique interior design concept of Hotel Tranz is inspired by Thewarat Sapharom Hall within Phya Thai Palace which was constructed during the reign of King Rama V in 1909.  <br>
		The transformation of time cross between the past & presence reflecting the preservation  of Thai tradition along with contemporary world as  to communicate the current essence of Today’s Thai culture.  
		While you walk throughout the hotel, you will notice the joyful spirit of Thai’s heritage harmonizing with simple form of architecture.</p>
		</div>
		</div>
	</div>
