	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
		<div class="title-box clearfix">
		<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 title-header"><h2>Accommodation</h2></div>
		<div class="col-lg-9 col-md-8 title-content">
		<h4>TAILOR TO SUIT COMFORT & STYLE</h4>
		<ul>
		<li>At Hotel Tranz, all guest room comprises Superior Room, Deluxe Suite and Executive Suite at 22, 26, 28 square meters vigorously designed to assure you a most pleasurable stay with the unique 
		signature of Eastern crafts & Western decoration as well as complete amenities and latest technology for in-room facilities & entertainments.</li>
		<li>Enjoy 32 inches or 43 inches (limited for Deluxe or Executive suites)  LED TV with variety of 70 channels.</li>
		<li>Hi-Speed internet with individual access point in each guest room to ensure more than sufficient connection</li>
		<li>For a pleasant sleep in our rooms, we also  prepare both soft & firm pillows for each guest’s preference. </li>
		</ul>
		</div>
		</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="container-fluid">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="contain">
			<div class="col-sm-12">
			<div class="row">
			<div id="slide-room" class="owl-carousel owl-theme">
			<div class="item" data-hash="executive3">
			<div class="row">
			<section class="accom-area clearfix">
			<div class="col-md-7"><div class="row"><img src="images/room/superior-01.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Superior room"></div></div>
			<div class="accom-box_right">
			<div class="accom-inner">		  
			<div class="accom-detial">
			<h2>Superior room<br><span>22 SQ.M</span></h2>
			<p>Simply bold decorated panel with signature blue color, our Superior room is designed to relieve stress for every guest. Enjoying full list of entertainment on 32” LED TV 
			and free hi-speed internet. Taking a hot or cold rain shower just before hitting our sweet comfort bed & mattress, a good night sleep has never been easier.</p>
			<h4>Amenities</h4>
			<div class="ic-amenities clearfix">
			<div class="icon-highlighted">
			<span><i class="lcd-tv"></i>LCD TV</span>
			<span><i class="wifi"></i>Free WiFi</span>
			<span><i class="air-conditioning"></i>Air-Con</span>
			<span><i class="hair-dryer"></i>Hair Dryer</span>
			<span><i class="bathroom-amenities"></i>Bathroom Amenities</span>			
			<span><i class="in-room-safe-box"></i>In room Safe box</span>
			</div>
			</div>	
			<a href="https://instant-bookings.com/ibs/bookings?hotelkey===QT6lEe" class="btn-flat btn-flat1 hvr-sweep-to-right">Book Now</a> 
			</div>
			</div> 
			</div>
			<div class="number-slide_room_main">
			<ul>
			<li><a class="arrow-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i></a></li>
			<li><a href="#executive1">01</a></li>
			<li><a href="#executive2">02</a></li>
			<li><a href="#executive3">03</a></li>
			</ul>
			</div>
			</section>	
			</div>
			</div>
			<div class="item" data-hash="executive2">
			<div class="row">
			<section class="accom-area clearfix">
			<div class="col-md-7">
			<div class="row"><img src="images/room/deluxe-01.jpg" class="img-responsive" alt="Deluxe room"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="accom-box_right">
			<div class="accom-inner">		  
			<div class="accom-detial">
			<h2>Deluxe room<br><span>28 SQ.M</span></h2>
			<p>Spacious elegant settings along with extra large sofa bed & complete amenities is our ideal kind of comfort.  Large King size bed & mattress is a heaven 
			for a good night sleep while the room is more than enough to serve an extra company of two.  Complimentary mini bar and drinking water is offered along with Nespresso machine. </p>
			<h4>Amenities</h4>
			<div class="ic-amenities clearfix">
			<div class="icon-highlighted"><span><i class="lcd-tv"></i>LCD TV</span><span><i class="wifi"></i>Free WiFi</span><span><i class="air-conditioning"></i>Air-Con</span><span><i class="hair-dryer"></i>Hair Dryer</span><span><i class="bathroom-amenities"></i>Bathroom Amenities</span><span><i class="coffeeMaking-machine"></i>Coffee Making Machine</span><span><i class="in-room-safe-box"></i>In room Safe box</span></div>	
			</div>	
			<a href="https://instant-bookings.com/ibs/bookings?hotelkey===QT6lEe" class="btn-flat btn-flat1 hvr-sweep-to-right">Book Now</a> 
			</div>
			</div> 
			</div>
			<div class="number-slide_room_main">
